      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZATARA'S IMAGE (8) is a sprinter who thrives over these shorter races. Scored over 300m at this track last time in a Free For All (17.24). Has a good record here at this journey including 10 wins. Well placed and will be tough to beat. CERULEAN POPPY (1) is boxed nicely on the inside. Latest effort finished 4th on July 21 over 400m at this track behind Aussie Brook beaten 7 lengths (22.85) in a Grade 5. Suited here and expected to run well. CRACKER DUST (2) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 0.8 lengths (17.29) behind ZATARA'S IMAGE at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Expecting another good run. REGENCY BOY (4) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
